  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 719e0f36396284344b6dff3be4420bca, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Sentences:
  - text: Artois wakes up in the ruins of the lab, with broken glass, scattered papers
      on the ground. The castle is eerily silent, with the occasional rumble shaking
      the ground.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: Illian is missing and the only thing left behind was the book his brother
      was working on that night.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: Illian had created a grimoire capable of great power, and with Artois help,
      he was one step closer to the last spell.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: Artois picks up the book and ventures through the castle looking for his
      brother. Good Luck!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
